            "id": 79126,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wiemy, jak powtarzać kod za pomocą pętli <code>while</code>. Tak jak w tym programie, który powtarza instrukcje, aby wyświetlić flagę Stanów Zjednoczonych.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"first_counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first_counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  first_counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"second_counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" second_counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  second_counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Używając <strong>pętli for</strong>, możemy pisać programy za pomocą znacznie mniejszej ilości kodu i ułatwić ich zrozumienie innym programistom.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79131,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby utworzyć taką pętlę <code>for</code>, dodajemy słowo kluczowe <code>for</code>, zmienną taką jak <code>i</code>, słowo <code>in</code> i na końcu <code>range():</code></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range():\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for</code>, następnie <code>i</code>, a potem <code>in</code>, <code>range():</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79130,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W pętli <code>for</code> możemy określić, ile razy chcemy wykonać naszą pętlę, za pomocą instrukcji <code>range()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy birthday to you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>range</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79128,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodanie liczby takiej jak <code>6</code> wewnątrz <code>range()</code> oznacza, że pętla wykona blok kodu 6 razy, od <code>0</code> do <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>range</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, a potem <code>6</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Liczba wewnątrz <code>range()</code> określa liczbę wykonań pętli, począwszy od <code>0</code>. Spraw, aby wyświetliła liczby od <code>0</code> do <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>range</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, <code>6</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmienna przed <code>in</code>, w tym przypadku <code>i</code>, jest zmienną licznikową. Określa, na którym powtórzeniu pętli obecnie jesteśmy.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For loops are great!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i</code>, a następnie <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmienna przed <code>in</code>, tutaj <code>i</code>, jest zmienną licznika. Wskazuje bieżące powtórzenie pętli.</p><p>Wyświetl licznik tak, aby <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> i <code>2</code> pojawiły się przed każdym komunikatem <code>For loops are great!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For loops are great!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i</code>, a następnie <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For keyword",
            "id": 79124,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki typ pętli to zawiera?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Are you ready?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pętla <code>for</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pętla <code>while</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pętla <code>for</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ten kod używa pętli <code>for</code>. Dlaczego komunikat <code>Are you ready?</code> pojawia się cztery razy?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Are you ready?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pętla jest wykonywana po jednym razie dla każdej wartości wygenerowanej przez <code>range(4)</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pętla <code>for</code> zawsze wykonuje cztery powtórzenia, niezależnie od zakresu.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Zmienna licznikowa <code>i</code> wyświetla komunikat cztery razy przed rozpoczęciem pętli.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pętla jest wykonywana po jednym razie dla każdej wartości wygenerowanej przez <code>range(4)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 79123,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdzie trafia zmienna pętli w pętli <code>for</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Przed słowem kluczowym <code>in</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Po instrukcji <code>range()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Przed słowem kluczowym <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmienną pętli <code>for</code> umieszczamy przed słowem kluczowym <code>in</code>.</p><p>Który nagłówek używa zmiennej <code>step</code> jako zmiennej pętli przez trzy powtórzenia?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for step in range(3):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for in step range(3):</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for range(3) in step:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for step in range(3):</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 79122,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Która zmienna jest zmienną licznikową pętli <code>for</code>? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>range</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W tej pętli <code>for</code> zmienna <code>i</code> jest zmienną licznikową.</p><p>Jakie wartości zostałyby wyświetlone, gdyby instrukcja <code>print(i)</code> znajdowała się wewnątrz pętli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Najpierw <code>0</code>, a potem <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Najpierw <code>1</code>, a potem <code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Najpierw <code>range</code>, a potem <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Najpierw <code>0</code>, a potem <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 79121,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ile razy <code>be like me</code> pojawi się w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody wants to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody wants to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">3</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">4</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz 3.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Która zmiana sprawi, że <code>be like me</code> pojawi się cztery razy, a reszta kodu pozostanie bez zmian?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody wants to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody wants to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zmień <code>range(3)</code> na <code>range(4)</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Przenieś <code>print(\"Everybody wants to\")</code> do wnętrza pętli.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Zmień <code>range(3)</code> na <code>range(2)</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zmień <code>range(3)</code> na <code>range(4)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing",
            "id": 79120,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co jest nie tak z tym kodem?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Brakuje zmiennej licznika po słowie kluczowym <code>for</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Z kodem jest wszystko w porządku</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Brakuje zmiennej licznika po słowie kluczowym <code>for</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pętla <code>for</code> wymaga zmiennej licznikowej po słowie kluczowym <code>for</code>.</p><p>Która zamiana poprawi pierwszy wiersz tak, aby zmienna <code>i</code> istniała podczas wykonywania pętli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for i in range(5):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for range(5) in i:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for i range(5):</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>for i in range(5):</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: For keyword",
            "id": 79118,
            "contentType": "interactive",
